desc="Turns the Google Gemini web app into an OpenAI-compatible API service with a built-in web console: credential management, model probes, usage stats, config editor and live logs. Supports /v1/chat/completions, streaming, function calling and multiple models. Call the API at http://<NAS-IP>:8081/v1; the console lives at /panel."
